OL,3,GNEWSABoy at heart of cannabis oil
OL,4,Acampaign in new fight for life-saving
OL,5,Adrug
OL,6,
OL,7,FEight years after winning a battle to
OL,8,Fget cannabis oil on prescription for
OL,9,Ftheir seriously ill son, a Warwickshire
OL,10,Ffamily is facing a new fight to keep
OL,11,Fhis supply of the drug.
OL,13,FIn 2018, Hannah Deacon took her fight
OL,14,Fto Downing Street and won the right for
OL,15,Fher son Alfie, who has epilepsy, to
OL,16,Fhave the medication on the NHS. However
OL,17,Fshe passed away suddenly in 2024.
OL,19,FNow, there is a new threat to the
OL,20,Fsupply of the drug as the company which
OL,21,Fmakes it has gone bankrupt.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
