OL,3,GNEWSABoy at heart of cannabis oil
OL,4,Acampaign in new fight for life-saving
OL,5,Adrug
OL,6,
OL,7,FHannah's mum Maggie Deacon has taken up
OL,8,Fcampaigning in her daughter's memory
OL,9,Fand said: "Alfie wouldn't be with us if
OL,10,Fhe didn't have this medicine, that's
OL,11,Fthe reality."
